<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_6_4" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_6_4">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_6_4" name="3.6.4 Process Water Supply &amp; Distribution" processRef="Process_L3_3_6_4"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_6_4" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L1/L2 Process. Blends recovered water (thickener overflow, filtrate), reclaim water, recovered seepage and makeup water in process water storage and distributes process water to plant users — grinding, flotation, reagent make-up, wash and gland water.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_6_4">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_6_4_ctl" name="Control Room Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_4_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_6_4_dcs" name="DCS Auto-control">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_6_4_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_6_4_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_6_4_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_6_4_s" name="Plant water demand">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1" name="3.6.4.1 Blend Water Sources in Process Water Storage">
      <bpmn:documentation>Recovered, reclaim and seepage water fill process water storage first; makeup water tops up the balance. Storage level and water quality (suspended solids, pH, dissolved salts) are monitored, because recycled water quality affects flotation. [WATER: level and volume (process water storage) | level sensor | continuous | MCA WAF | NO — WP-11]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Control Room Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g" name="Process water storage below minimum?" default="Flow_L3_3_6_4_3">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2" name="3.6.4.2 Distribute Process Water to Users">
      <bpmn:documentation>Distribution pumps deliver process water to its users at the required pressure. Use by user (grinding, flotation, reagent make-up, wash) is metered where instruments exist; total distribution is the plant's process water use. [WATER: volume (distributed, per user) | flow meters | continuous | MCA WAF | NO — WP-10]
ISA-95 level: 1 / 2
Actors: DCS Auto-control
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 2; MCA WAF
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: water_flow_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_6_4_e" name="Process water delivered">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_6</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_6_4_n" name="Increase makeup draw; restrict non-essential use">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Low process water storage response; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_6_4_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_6_4_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_6_4_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_3" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g" targetRef="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_6_4_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_5" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_6_4_n" targetRef="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_6" sourceRef="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2" targetRef="End_L3_3_6_4_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_6_4">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_6_4" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_6_4">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_6_4_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_6_4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1024" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_6_4_ctl_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_6_4_ctl" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="984" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_6_4_dcs_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_6_4_dcs" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="984" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_6_4_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_6_4_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_6_4_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="522" y="240" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="451" y="190" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Service_L3_3_6_4_3_6_4_2"><dc:Bounds x="678" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_6_4_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_6_4_e"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="309" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_6_4_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_6_4_n"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="522" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_3"><di:waypoint x="592" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="678" y="275"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="596" y="255" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_4"><di:waypoint x="557" y="240"/><di:waypoint x="557" y="145"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="563" y="222" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_5"><di:waypoint x="642" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="763" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="763" y="235"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_6_4_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_6_4_6"><di:waypoint x="848" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
